The problem asks you to determine: Which index pair does this scan return?
int[] a = {1, 3, 5, 8, 11, 14, 17, 21};
int i = 0, j = a.length - 1;
while (i < j) { int s = a[i] + a[j]; if (s == 32) return new int[]{i, j}; if (s < 32) i++; else j--; }
return new int[]{-1, -1};

